        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 173 cm\n\nKrai is the leader of Grieving Souls, a party he started with his gifted childhood friends when they all strived to be the strongest party ever. Krai quickly realized he was not gifted like his childhood friends, he's in fact very weak only being able to fight with relics he has collected.\n\nHe's a level 8 hunter and is considered one of the strongest hunters in the city. Everyone thinks he's the smartest person in the city, thinking every word he says has a meaning, even if he's just joking around. Whatever he says is always taken very seriously and when the enemy knows he's nearby they always try to escape. But despite all this, he's unmotivated, sloppy, regular human being and doesn't want to get dragged into troublesome events. Generally, Krai always brings disasters along with him, much to the woe of the many.",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "20"
